OL,3,GNEWSA'Nightmare' airport chaos leaves
OL,4,Apassengers stranded
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers from the West of England say
OL,7,Ftheir holidays have been "ruined" after
OL,8,Fa UK-wide air traffic control issue
OL,9,Fcaused flight cancellations and delays.
OL,11,FAngela Bolitho, 62, of
OL,12,FWeston-super-Mare, Somerset, described
OL,13,Fa trip to Edinburgh with her son as a
OL,14,F"nightmare" after their return flight
OL,15,Fto Bristol from Scotland was cancelled.
OL,17,FAnother passenger, Liam Graham, 27,
OL,18,Ffrom Bradley Stoke, South
OL,19,FGloucestershire, said he spent seven
OL,20,Fhours sitting on a plane at Bristol
OL,21,FAirport bound for Bodrum in Turkey
OL,22,Fbefore being told it could not depart.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
