OL,3,GNEWSA'Nightmare' airport chaos leaves
OL,4,Apassengers stranded
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Bristol Airport spokesperson said
OL,7,Fflights were "mostly back to normal
OL,8,Fwith a small number of delays and
OL,9,Fcancellations".
